    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lythe The Forgetful Witch: A Visual Novel</i> is a reimagining of the classic tale of <i>The Wizard of Oz</i>, featuring horror monsters in a spooky land called Samhain, which exists in perpetual night. Follow the na\u00efve young witch, Lythe, as she navigates her journey to find the High Witch of Samhain with her apathetic Sphinx cat Bartholomew and a disgruntled grimoire named Grimm. Along the way, Lythe's friendships spark change, helping each character pursue their deepest desires\u2014whether it's a brain, heart, or courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in spell crafting, seek runes, and play memory games as you guide Lythe to rediscover her magical abilities and influence the fate of her companions!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Lythe The Forgetful Witch: A Visual Novel</i> is a reimagining of the classic tale of <i>The Wizard of Oz</i>, featuring horror monsters in a spooky land called Samhain, which exists in perpetual night. Follow the na\u00efve young witch, Lythe, as she navigates her journey to find the High Witch of Samhain with her apathetic Sphinx cat Bartholomew and a disgruntled grimoire named Grimm. Along the way, Lythe's friendships spark change, helping each character pursue their deepest desires\u2014whether it's a brain, heart, or courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in spell crafting, seek runes, and play memory games as you guide Lythe to rediscover her magical abilities and influence the fate of her companions!</p>",
    "short_description": "Guide Lythe, a na\u00efve witch on a journey through the spooky world of Samhain, as she seeks the High Witch and rediscovers her magic. This visual novel features spell crafting, rune seeking, and memory game mechanics, all while unraveling the desires of her monstrous friends!",
